<title>PORTUGAL: Engil, Mello to join PSI-20.</title>
<headline>Engil, Mello to join PSI-20.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Engil-SGPS and Banco Mello will join the PSI-20 index of Portugal's 20 most liquid stocks in the first half of 1997, Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) said.</p>
<p>The two companies will replace cork group Corticeira Amorim and wood products group Sonae Industria, a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
